Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.29,0:23:20.57,edcn4,,0,0,0,,{\frz270\fn@\fad(120,120)\pos(1890,850)\blur4}好呀 來玩遊戲吧 ！滿心愛意
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.57,0:23:24.20,edcn4,,0,0,0,,{\frz270\fn@\fad(120,120)\pos(1890,780)\blur4}我發現我並不在乎輸贏
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.31,0:23:28.24,edcn4,,0,0,0,,{\frz270\fn@\fad(120,120)\pos(1890,790)\blur4}只是心懷更單純的感情
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.24,0:23:36.17,edcn4,,0,0,0,,{\frz270\fn@\fad(120,120)\pos(1890,710)\blur4}接下來輪到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.33,0:22:49.40,edjp4,,0,0,0,,{\frz270\fn@\fad(120,120)\pos(70,700)\blur4}君が知らない秘密
